[{"title":"读司马季主传","author":"林大钦","text":"伊昔楚高人，逃名在东韨。\n筮卜留行春，达观何侈瀰。\n谈笑羲皇前，著论穷人天。\n道悠喧莫染，迹杳意弥绵。\n二贤何规规，玉颜空磷缁。\n尘海烟波阔，坐令蛟龙悲。\n涉江采芳兰，摘菊时为欢。\n雅志辞烦力，幽居意漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读东方朔传","author":"林大钦","text":"达人无不可，于世若游云。\n能与尘俗并，而不撄垢氛。\n昂藏入君门，浪谑金马春。\n要君输玉帛，醉酒若为伦。\n纵横真琐琐，剖心何如我。\n得意傲尧天，微言寄青琐。\n予无混世姿，行止尚规规。\n相期在何处，石室紫芝涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读山海经","author":"林大钦","text":"二仪信寥廓，九域安能详。\n东怀君子国，西望昆崙方。\n扶桑何修疏，青鸟三危傍。\n帝江识歌舞，王母独灵长。\n予亦乘文螭，戴胜观四荒。\n开明恣幽陟，平圃纵翱翔。\n赤水足吾饮，祝馀供吾粮。\n逍遥八百春，寿考岂渠央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林塘歌","author":"林大钦","text":"爱此林塘静，伊游获吾初。\n壮心逐风景，遂与功名疏。\n兰幽人不锄，云閒空捲舒。\n日出林鸟鸣，东轩恣睢徐。\n绻然陶一觞，摘此园中蔬。\n世味非所希，我怀日悠虚。\n缅想采芝翁，时以慰居诸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对酒歌","author":"林大钦","text":"今日曷不乐，幸时犹清平。\n酌此一杯酒，永我千古情。\n兰芳何菲菲，秋露泛其英。\n眷彼日月周，我生不再荣。\n杳此林下意，永辞区中名。\n夭寿非所知，得失何足萦。\n浩歌白日动，徙倚黄云生。\n坐啸碧山春，颓然恣吾行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下吟","author":"林大钦","text":"明月度中天，流光在东户。\n借问谪仙人，呼月何如予。\n月明澄云霞，月色令人嗟。\n今人照古月，今月尚流华。\n今古月如此，人事空流水。\n长愿当尊歌，向月问终始。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3276,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀友","author":"林大钦","text":"平生寡所欢，与子终邂逅。\n悠悠五湖春，云山阻欢觏。\n目断南来鸿，心攒天边岫。\n始愿今难从，相期在玄守。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3277,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"啸歌二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"山高不可登，河深岂可厉。\n平原九万里，翱翔足游曳。\n白龙在深渊，海水扬其波。\n误落湘江蹊，泥沙奈尔何。\n白玉一杯酒，青云在轩牗。\n笑拉洪涯肩，轩荣复何有。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3278,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"啸歌二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"山中白云歌，天上彩云缓。\n时乘明玕车，笑接渊明盏。\n我生欲何为，轩裳空依依。\n时增陵谷思，羲皇胡不归。\n青阳动芳草，白日嗟沦老。\n卓荦观前进，旷然清怀抱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3279,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望月歌","author":"林大钦","text":"归来白云眠，对月时翩跹。\n抚己事并拙，乐天心悠然。\n身在羲皇后，心在无怀先。\n履运增慨歌，俯仰复何言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云谣","author":"林大钦","text":"烟波不可涉，且向白云归。\n好鸟人共语，悬萝春拂衣。\n高山增仰望，尘想日初稀。\n吾爱茹芝老，时清犹息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归来谣二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"归来物外情，日与园林亲。\n耕凿安时化，衣冠随世春。\n前途当不惑，远志期所遵。\n已矣歌采芝，聊与静者伦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归来谣二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"田园今卧稳，悠然生事稀。\n源水看花入，春云羡鸟飞。\n壶觞时独进，耕凿复忘机。\n霭霭浮烟外，樵歌慰式微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醒来谣","author":"林大钦","text":"颓然卧前楹，日觉天地清。\n秉拙捐时好，因书见古情。\n鸟雀花留语，芝兰夕流荣。\n栖迟衡宇下，庶以善自名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居","author":"林大钦","text":"窈窕青云宇，流连沧海思。\n帝乡不可愿，芳草共相期。\n清阴盈径户，好鸟恋幽枝。\n何事杨朱子，临涂泣路岐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"达人吟","author":"林大钦","text":"达人能解俗，处世贵藏晖。\n而我屏心想，颓然任冥微。\n新沐莫弹冠，新浴莫振衣。\n污泥出红莲，斯道可同归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浅水吟","author":"林大钦","text":"浅水堪跃足，卑枝可结巢。\n水浅波浪少，枝卑风不高。\n鲁连辞齐组，东海何嚣嚣。\n商鞅倾秦宠，法令自煎熬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园幽兴六首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"青山容我放，水竹静幽居。\n树啭檐间鸟，花閒几上书。\n役役诚何事，悠悠心自虚。\n年来游冶意，天地一萧疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园幽兴六首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"净心遗纷业，悠志在无为。\n坐爱窗间草，閒吟梁甫词。\n万事嗟牢落，一丘已定居。\n沧浪濯清足，在昔皆余师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园幽兴六首 其三","author":"林大钦","text":"所居在人境，心远迹无喧。\n佳辰携良朋，樽酌开话言。\n轩华何足贵，清真道在敦。\n无然随物化，幽桂足芳根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3290,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园幽兴六首 其四","author":"林大钦","text":"寸心不为薄，斗酒乐亲知。\n列席无杂语，相慰在道岐。\n出处何必同，清脩方自兹。\n冉冉风尘间，无然日磷缁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3291,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园幽兴六首 其五","author":"林大钦","text":"黄鹤不可招，蓬海事多遥。\n青门聊种树，白日结云谣。\n道悠心莫染，迹杳意弥超。\n千秋风雅意，兹以永今朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3292,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园幽兴六首 其六","author":"林大钦","text":"颓然白云间，渔樵人事稀。\n松风吹解带，潭水照行衣。\n良辰畅幽惬，沆瀁安是非。\n朝阳从变化，吾生本息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3293,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草亭检书遣怀二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"朝来梳栉罢，独坐草玄亭。\n花齐千谷秀，春送万峰青。\n引玩书连屋，纵横树拂庭。\n餐霞吾不忝，真此慰幽惺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3294,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草亭检书遣怀二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"细草迷通岸，悬崖气色新。\n幽斋花竞早，胜日柳争春。\n习定今忘我，希空不系尘。\n多将琴史意，遮莫采芳辰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3295,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春园对酒","author":"林大钦","text":"胜夕依繁圃，花晴更属春。\n重开今日酒，不见古时人。\n风景依稀在，乾坤去住身。\n且随人意得，披豁晤情真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3296,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病隐","author":"林大钦","text":"病隐真无事，幽栖偏自怡。\n还寻高士传，更读考槃诗。\n野蝶穿花落，春风语鸟迟。\n未须沧海去，即此羡閒居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3297,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"林大钦","text":"云馀开卧席，可以娱终生。\n啸谑乾坤大，优游今古情。\n萝盘千谷秀，花发一园清。\n吾志烟霄外，勋名何足营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3298,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧起","author":"林大钦","text":"云眠不觉晓，旭日已盈林。\n不习丘中趣，安知静者心。\n众芳足幽气，佳楼来幻音。\n抚景怀三益，栖迟时一吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3299,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柴门遣兴四首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"柴扉依畎亩，幽事正相关。\n源水看鱼跃，花林羡鸟閒。\n尧樽歌圣代，汉蕨足春山。\n谁能共冥漠，来往烟萝间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3300,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柴门遣兴四首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"轩荣非所便，旷略反予真。\n耕凿人间世，萝苔物外伦。\n商歌非有待，浊酒岂无春。\n生兹年华转，林塘花色新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3301,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柴门遣兴四首 其三","author":"林大钦","text":"卜宅青山近，临门水色新。\n林花春滋碧，巢燕语随人。\n漫兴难和侣，投冠差独真。\n栖迟琴史意，幸得过芳辰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3302,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柴门遣兴四首 其四","author":"林大钦","text":"颇怪生涯懒，应耽野兴长。\n暮春高云日，诗酒恣清狂。\n种竹幽堪玩，为农道益臧。\n何妨与点也，吾意自堂堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3303,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣意","author":"林大钦","text":"今古残春地，乾坤一布衣。\n清溪吟落日，芳草惜幽扉。\n渐与人俗远，难教鸥鹭违。\n东风吹几杖，应采北山薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3304,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春原行乐","author":"林大钦","text":"悠然物外情，况值园林清。\n春泉采芝去，苔堰听莺行。\n云与山扉静，花漾池塘生。\n即事已幽惬，身世两无营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3305,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三日遣兴","author":"林大钦","text":"沙暄风野润，日色上松枝。\n閒听莺声啭，长吟韨褉诗。\n江山如有意，花木更无私。\n兴与芳春会，重烟起夕思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3306,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居","author":"林大钦","text":"高斋春寂寞，步履意回迟。\n独酌深林晚，难酬支遁思。\n风暄低彩蝶，日寂萦芳枝。\n聊屏交游会，幽拙谢当时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3307,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客至","author":"林大钦","text":"寂寞郊扉地，晴光瀰望辰。\n门从花胜竹，客到酒当春。\n牢落看莺晚，流连发兴频。\n残晖与幽色，披豁共吾真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3308,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自嘲","author":"林大钦","text":"杨子谈经处，柴门春草暄。\n风光惊节换，幽兴与谁言。\n牢落蓼花酒，支离苦柏餐。\n图书馀万卷，吟诵自朝昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3309,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有客","author":"林大钦","text":"风烟还梓里，山水仲长园。\n有客过茅宇，呼童具醁尊。\n清歌宜白日，粗粝足寒温。\n兴阑栖鸟散，相将到石门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3310,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谩成","author":"林大钦","text":"独有江海情，偏随物候新。\n云烟馀潦倒，麋鹿共和春。\n日月高歌遍，乾坤酌酒频。\n祇今农卧稳，披豁露吾真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3311,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋夜","author":"林大钦","text":"草虫鸣前除，中宵步绮虚。\n月明侵卧内，花馥袭吾裾。\n时序催归疾，尘心向晚疏。\n故园潇湘意，应拟邵平居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3312,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻蛙","author":"林大钦","text":"蛙声悲永夜，感激入天真。\n咿喔如求侣，喧呼不避人。\n藏身似未捷，伏草已馀春。\n念尔嗟时化，悽悽怆吾神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3313,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观云起雨至","author":"林大钦","text":"云气生层岳，溶溶满太虚。\n因风过越隽，洒雨到阶除。\n润圃花初馥，净心尘踰疏。\n乾坤增气象，披豁看林庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3314,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨馀","author":"林大钦","text":"雨馀烟景绿，花夕池塘春。\n游云增旷望，白日静幽沦。\n抚景羞玄发，遗时欣独新。\n衡门今古意，萧散采芳辰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3315,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"霁","author":"林大钦","text":"夙雨霁氛埃，南山佳色来。\n思随飞鸟逸，兴与浮云开。\n漂泊成何事，乾坤付酒杯。\n芜然春欲暮，空悲蕙草摧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3316,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中新竹","author":"林大钦","text":"细雨稍欲过，新竹自欣欣。\n微根初出地，高势欲凌云。\n孤直自天性，清苍映夕矄。\n春深花更落，赖此扫尘氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3317,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草室","author":"林大钦","text":"草室连村水，幽林一径微。\n云从花上度，客到荜中稀。\n听鸟人共得，扪萝心弗违。\n晴春归卧处，衰劣定吾依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3318,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予园","author":"林大钦","text":"予园幽寂寞，妙思齐虚无。\n草径断来往，佳辰赖浊酤。\n山林弹琴尽，烟花入望迂。\n慷慨伤时暮，鱼樵乃吾徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3319,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧起即事三首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"雨意云垂白，榴青花欲燃。\n残春静散地，飞鸟夕阳天。\n道羡尘机灭，幽称树里眠。\n风光共流换，何处问安禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3320,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧起即事三首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"云光互明灭，燕雀暂飞沉。\n风景每如此，潇骚乐在今。\n试索花间卧，羞从泽畔吟。\n尘机兹已矣，空有紫霞心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3321,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧起即事三首 其三","author":"林大钦","text":"饭草心犹乐，云眠道益安。\n烟花从节换，风雨恣春残。\n杜甫惭真隐，陶潜已挂冠。\n他时论出处，江海意漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3322,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒门","author":"林大钦","text":"閒门芳草寂，坐令青春深。\n考索非吾事，栖迟聊独吟。\n松风吹带袖，山月净悠襟。\n于兹谢烦力，永得静者心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3323,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予楼诸山环立时寄栖迟愿言攸居谩成四韵四首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"桑莆名自昔，苍翠复若兹。\n高峰拂天汉，秀色并吾居。\n窗开青嶂入，帘捲白云滋。\n更有烟霞想，冥然定尔期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3324,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予楼诸山环立时寄栖迟愿言攸居谩成四韵四首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"南山饶古意，石壁自倾崎。\n苔藓烟云湿，苍松春色垂。\n开窗挹秀气，隐几照清姿。\n素是烟霞客，时增寥廓思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3325,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予楼诸山环立时寄栖迟愿言攸居谩成四韵四首 其三","author":"林大钦","text":"凤凰何代有，回薄万古心。\n天空时一望，复见此山岑。\n连峰云出没，挂汉月清深。\n登陟怜幽绝，冥心可脱簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3326,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予楼诸山环立时寄栖迟愿言攸居谩成四韵四首 其四","author":"林大钦","text":"青嶂环碧空，吾庐山色中。\n三峰横秀气，五岭郁穹窿。\n野色摇春日，秋云度晚风。\n平生饶幽意，于此慰穷通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3327,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"畎亩","author":"林大钦","text":"畎亩荆桑外，孤亭草雾中。\n青莎晴白日，黄鸟舞春风。\n花下琴书并，人间巾履同。\n尚思高卧稳，因此拟华嵩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3328,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一室","author":"林大钦","text":"一室喧纷远，幽林卧起迟。\n游丝飞白日，晴鸟度芳思。\n黄绮终辞汉，箕阳卜此居。\n栖迟琴史意，幸得过明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3329,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂遣兴","author":"林大钦","text":"日月浮生易，乾坤一室馀。\n高山频怅望，流水助萧疏。\n道迥堪藜藿，情玄归素初。\n年来浑无事，犹得寄耕渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3330,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽栖","author":"林大钦","text":"幽栖却得性，永与白云归。\n听鸟思轻举，看山忆采薇。\n樗栎谁堪并，琴樽趣不稀。\n烟花彭泽里，出处幸无违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3331,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野情","author":"林大钦","text":"世事风波远，悠悠荔薜春。\n乾坤未老日，烟洞独归人。\n小屋閒堪赋，云泉意不贫。\n翻随鱼鸟会，飞兴洒衣巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3332,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中夏即事","author":"林大钦","text":"凯风回前林，中夏馀清阴。\n百卉开和泽，晴蝉悲夕吟。\n屏交事绝帙，怀古怅予襟。\n缅然思八极，永清尘外心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3333,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乍雨","author":"林大钦","text":"乍雨消炎燠，莲塘春色生。\n青开平野望，香送百花清。\n乳雀频将子，山蜂远趁晴。\n故园风景在，潇洒欲忘名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3334,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林下独酌","author":"林大钦","text":"日明鸟自散，而我卧空林。\n独对山中酒，时超物外心。\n青萝乘野径，芳草澹幽襟。\n若问穷通理，应依楚凤吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3335,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桑麻遣兴二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"上天垂雨露，何物不生春。\n甘苦齐结实，麻桑更拂人。\n乐幽心愈淡，敦土道为邻。\n满眼缘生事，离披浑性真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3336,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桑麻遣兴二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"世路懒抟扶，山林祇自迂。\n卧幽千古迥，披豁一虚无。\n点咏随歌鸟，陶尊赖浊酤。\n行欢终宇宙，意绪不荒芜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3337,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晴轩","author":"林大钦","text":"蓬门今卧稳，野草思氤氲。\n轩岳来清气，晴窗检白云。\n渐与人俗远，转于鸥鹭群。\n东风吹几杖，不歉北山文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3338,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蔓草","author":"林大钦","text":"蔓草伤极目，芳辰谁为携。\n蝉鸣风树杪，雨过草堂西。\n物候清神寂，虚怀迥不迷。\n祇应存吾道，出处问葵藜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3339,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]